{%- comment -%}
  NAP-blok (Name / Address / Phone)
  ----------------------------------
  Centrale weergave van de GMC-bedrijfsgegevens uit Theme Settings
  (settings.gmc_*). Wordt gebruikt in footer, About us en Contact,
  zodat de gegevens overal identiek zijn — dat is zelf een GMC-vereiste
  (NAP-consistentie).

  Toont alleen velden die zijn ingevuld. Leeg = niets tonen, geen
  placeholders op de live site.

  Parameters (optioneel):
    show_heading : bool  — toont "Business details"-kopje boven het blok
    class        : string — extra CSS-klasse op de wrapper
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign has_name = settings.gmc_company_name | default: '' | strip
  assign has_address = settings.gmc_address_line1 | default: '' | strip
  assign has_contact = settings.gmc_phone | default: '' | strip
  assign has_email = settings.gmc_email | default: '' | strip
  assign has_hours = settings.gmc_hours | default: '' | strip
  assign has_reply = settings.gmc_reply_time | default: '' | strip
  assign has_reg = settings.gmc_registration_number | default: '' | strip
  assign has_dba = settings.gmc_dba_line | default: '' | strip
-%}

{%- if has_name != '' or has_address != '' or has_contact != '' or has_email != '' -%}
  <div class="nap-block{% if class %} {{ class }}{% endif %}">
    {%- if show_heading -%}
      <p class="nap-block__heading">Business details</p>
    {%- endif -%}

    <ul class="nap-block__list list-unstyled" role="list">
      {%- if has_name != '' -%}
        <li class="nap-block__item nap-block__item--name">{{ settings.gmc_company_name | escape }}</li>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if has_address != '' -%}
        <li class="nap-block__item nap-block__item--address">
          {{ settings.gmc_address_line1 | escape }}{% if settings.gmc_address_line2 != blank %}, {{ settings.gmc_address_line2 | escape }}{% endif %}<br>
          {%- assign city_line = '' -%}
          {%- if settings.gmc_address_city != blank -%}{% assign city_line = settings.gmc_address_city %}{%- endif -%}
          {%- if settings.gmc_address_region != blank -%}{% assign city_line = city_line | append: ', ' | append: settings.gmc_address_region %}{%- endif -%}
          {%- if settings.gmc_address_zip != blank -%}{% assign city_line = city_line | append: ' ' | append: settings.gmc_address_zip %}{%- endif -%}
          {{ city_line | escape }}
          {%- if settings.gmc_address_country != blank -%}<br>{{ settings.gmc_address_country | escape }}{%- endif -%}
        </li>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if has_reg != '' -%}
        <li class="nap-block__item nap-block__item--registration">
          {{ settings.gmc_registration_label | default: 'Registration no.' | escape }}: {{ settings.gmc_registration_number | escape }}
        </li>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if has_contact != '' -%}
        <li class="nap-block__item nap-block__item--phone">
          <a href="tel:{{ settings.gmc_phone | strip | replace: ' ', '' }}">{{ settings.gmc_phone | escape }}</a>
        </li>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if has_email != '' -%}
        <li class="nap-block__item nap-block__item--email">
          <a href="mailto:{{ settings.gmc_email | strip }}">{{ settings.gmc_email | escape }}</a>
        </li>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if has_hours != '' -%}
        <li class="nap-block__item nap-block__item--hours">{{ settings.gmc_hours | escape }}</li>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if has_reply != '' -%}
        <li class="nap-block__item nap-block__item--reply">{{ settings.gmc_reply_time | escape }}</li>
      {%- endif -%}
    </ul>

    {%- comment -%}
      DBA-regel: koppelt merknaam aan juridische entiteit als die verschillen
      (bv. "Cavo Hill is a brand operated by Novelle House LLC"). Leeg = niets
      tonen, zelfde patroon als de rest van het blok.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if has_dba != '' -%}
      <p class="nap-block__dba">{{ settings.gmc_dba_line | escape }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
